  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Up to three willing creatures you can see within 30 ft (one more per slot level above 3) fall Unconscious for 10 minutes. It ends on a creature if it takes damage or someone uses an action to shake it awake. A creature that sleeps the full duration gains the benefits of a Short Rest (apply by hand) and can't be affected again until it finishes a Long Rest.</p>",
